# unpdf lists `canvas` as an optional dependency for rendering PDF pages to
# images. SmartRecap only extracts text, so canvas is never loaded — but
# installing it pulls in @mapbox/node-pre-gyp and a vulnerable node-tar, and it
# needs a native toolchain that a fresh EC2 box does not have.
#
# Skipping optional dependencies removes that whole subtree. If you ever need
# page rasterisation, remove this line and deal with the native build.
omit=optional
